# Security headers for the static site (Cloudflare Pages).
# Deliberately NOT set: Referrer-Policy no-referrer (the Firebase key restriction needs the referrer),
# Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy (it breaks the Google sign-in popup), and a full Content-Security-Policy
# (it must be tested against real Google and Firebase sign-in first). See BACKEND_GUIDE.md section 11.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
